 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Not weird in the slightest. Lots of normal people like mysteries and human behavior. What kind of stuff does she find creepy? No problem. What kind of stuff does she find creepy? Then stick with it and ask her about it. Lots of people find the stories upsetting, so it' good to know where they come from. Not at all. The podcasters usually give a short, respectable summary without sensationalizing. If anything, it shows you care about how the story ends. Then listen to them with someone you know well who loves the podcasts as an expert opinion. That's the smart move. You could also say you find them inspiring for your writing. Lots of writers cite them.",
